This job record includes the following fields:

- jobType: the trade of the main task: plumbing, electrical, hvac, carpentry, appliance, cleaning, painting, roofing, or general (handyman tasks).
- workPerformed: one short past-tense action per task done, verb first ("Replaced kitchen sink P-trap").
- issuesFound: problems the note reports finding on site, as noun phrases.
- materials: things the note says were used or put in, with an amount or as supplies.
- laborMinutes: total labor in minutes, as an integer; add separately stated times; null if no time is given.
- customerApproved: true only on an explicit yes (signed off, approved, gave the go-ahead); false only on an explicit no; otherwise null.
- followUps: future actions only.
- go-ahead: true only on an explicit yes (signed off, approved, gave the go-ahead); false only on an explicit no; otherwise null.
